    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "FOR MOTION DISCOMFORT POUR LE MAL DE L'AIR\nCLOSE BY FOLDING TOWARD YOU\nCLAMP SHUT WITH THE TABS\nGALL CABIN ATTENDANT FOR DISPOSAL\nFERMEZ LE SAC APRES USAGE\nGIN RUMMY\nCOLOR PRINT FILM\n128 Cartridge\n128 Cartridge\n110 Certridga\n110 Cartridge\n135\n135\n127, 620, 120\nSUDES \u0026 MOVIES\n128, 110 or 135\n135\n8MM or Super 8 Movie\nMAILING INSTRUCTIONS:\n1. Print your nama and address on a small\nslip of paper and attach to the film.\n2. Enclose the proper remittance and add\n50° per roll for postage and handling\non domestic orders. Foreign orders will\nbe billed for airmail return.\nEXPOSURES PER ROLL\n12\n20\n12\n20\n20 or 24\n36\n8 or 12\nEXPOSURES PER ROLL\n20\n36\nPRICE\n1.79\n3.39\n2.18\n3.59\n4.19\n5.79\n2.49\nPRICE\n1.69\n2.79\n1.69\n3. Make checks or Money Orders payable\nto Family Film Club.\n4. Seal bag with tabs and tape or staple\nsecurely. See the postage rate schedule\non the front for proper domestic\npostage.",
